# Clyffy_Avatar — SOURCE + TOOLS ONLY (operator ruling 2026-07-29)
#
# On disk this project is 13 GB. Almost none of it is source. The pipeline in tools/ is
# 824 KB and rebuilds everything under mesh/ from the base mesh; work/ is scratch. Committing
# the outputs would make a public repo nobody can clone, and two files exceed GitHub's HARD
# 100 MB limit outright (the voice GGUFs at 406 MB and 124 MB — LFS does not help, they are
# rejected at push).
#
# What this repo IS: the 12-stage Blender pipeline, the pack SSOT, the gates, the docs, and
# the reference the work is measured against. Clone it, run the chain, get the avatar.

# ── DERIVED GEOMETRY (3.8 GB) — tools/ rebuilds all of it ────────────────────
# 184 .blend = 5.2 GB · 9 .vrm = 657 MB. mesh/canon/* is the OUTPUT of the chain
# documented in tools/rebuild.sh --from-scratch, not its input.
mesh/

# ── SCRATCH (8.4 GB) ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Staging dirs, probe renders, voice models, demo builds. Nothing here is authored.
work/

# ── ⚠️ SHOW-BIBLE ART — DELIBERATELY EXCLUDED FROM A PUBLIC REPO ────────────
# canon/CLYFFY/ is the DevPULSE / AngryVibes show material pulled from the operator's private
# Drive. This repository is PUBLIC and git history is effectively permanent, so it is excluded
# by DEFAULT rather than by omission. The operator can add it deliberately; nobody can
# un-publish it afterwards.
# Restore locally with: ./pull-canon.sh   (needs the operator's read-only Drive remote)
canon/CLYFFY/
canon/docs/

# ── Blender autosaves (39 files, 1 GB) ──────────────────────────────────────
*.blend1
*.blend2

# ── The OLD rollback scheme, which git replaces ──────────────────────────────
# Before this repo existed, every promotion wrote a `.pre-<phase>` sibling. That is what
# version control is for; the siblings stay local and are not history.
*.pre-*
*.bak
*.bak.blend

# ── Python / tooling noise ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
node_modules/

# ── OS / editor ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
*.swp
*~

# ── ⚠️ WHOLE-CAST ELEMENT TOKENS — excluded from a PUBLIC repo ───────────────
# canon/_MASTER_REGISTRY.md tabulates higgsfield element-token UUIDs for ALL ELEVEN show
# characters, most of them unreleased. They are resource identifiers rather than credentials
# (useless without the operator's account auth) but they are unreleased-show IP and public git
# history cannot be withdrawn. Restore locally with ./pull-canon.sh
canon/_MASTER_REGISTRY.md
